B.a0E=s(["This is a casual entertainment game using virtual chips. Virtual chips may be purchased with real money, but cannot be exchanged for, redeemed as, or withdrawn into any real currency, cash, or goods. Purchases and ads are only used to obtain or restore in-game progress.","We do not collect your real name or address. To provide game services we may process limited temporary data (e.g. local game progress).","If advertising is enabled, ad partners may process device advertising identifiers (GAID/AAID) per platform policy to serve personalized ads. See third-party policies for details."],t.s)
B.WI=s(["This game is intended for players aged 18 and older.","All in-game virtual chips (whether obtained for free or purchased) are for entertainment only and cannot be exchanged for cash, goods, or any real currency. No gambling is involved.","Please play moderately and rest regularly. If you or someone you know struggles with gambling, seek professional help."],t.s)
B.oe=new A.a7(B.a8z,["Auto-playing","Auto-playing \xb7 tap to take over","FlingDeck","FlingDeck","FlingDeck","Quick","Start Match","Create Room","How to Play","Events","Home","Rooms","Settings","Profile","Chips","Coming Soon","Friend rooms are in development. Stay tuned.","Returning to Home in 3 seconds","Shop","Select Room","Random","Friends","Players","4P","3P","Novice","Advanced","Expert","Master","Absent","Practice Room","No chips needed \xb7 500 practice pts daily","Practice","Daily practice points used up. Come back tomorrow","Practice Points Exhausted","Practice Limit Reached","You reached the 1000 daily practice limit. Return to lobby to convert, then come back tomorrow","Converted {amount} chips","Convert practice points (watch ad)","No convertible points, or daily limit reached","; exiting will deduct {-amount} practice points","Multiplier","Base","Entry","Enter","Create","Share","Copy","Copy Link","System Share","QR Code","Friends enter the room code to join","Invite friends to play together","Create Room","Room Type","Chip","Score","Multiplier","Classic","Room Name","Password","Set password","Private Room","Cancel","Create","Game","Exit","Leave Game","Are you sure you want to leave the current game?","\n\nLeaving will deduct {amount} chips by remaining cards","\n\nLeaving will record {-amount} points by remaining cards","Round","Pass","Hint","Play","Your Turn","Waiting...","Player","Me","Diamond 3 Lead","Lead","First play must include","Result","You Won","You Lost","Rank","Cards Left","Plays","Bombs","Chips Earned","Next Round","Lobby","Score","Matching","Finding players...","Found","Gathering the bold, drums await","All gathered. Begin!","Seeking","{n} of {total} seated","Cancel","s","Settings","Sound","Vibration","Notifications","Play Direction","CCW","CW","About","Privacy","Responsible Gaming","Account","Guest","Bind Account","Logout","Friend Room","Code","Waiting for players","Start","Leave","Only 3 players","Confirm 3P","Spectating","You are spectating","No Chips","Watch Ad +{n}","Watch Ad for Chips","Retry","Lobby","Room Full","Disconnected","Reconnect","Match Failed","You need more chips to enter this room. Watch a video to top up.","Balance Too High","Your chips exceed this room limit. Join a higher multiplier room.","Need","Above room cap, join a higher room","Daily ad reward quota reached. Try again tomorrow.","Relief reward granted +100","Privacy & Responsible Play","Privacy Policy",B.a0E,"Responsible Gaming",B.WI,"Hosted policy link copied to clipboard (replace with a real URL before release)","Go to Higher Room","Back","Daily Bonus","Consecutive","Claim Today","Claimed","Round {n}","{n}-day streak","Day","Today","Prize","Lost This Round","Watch a video to refund {amount} chips","Watch Ad \xb7 Refund {amount}","Skip \xb7 Next Round","100","Retry","Switch Room","Disconnected","Check your connection and retry","Match Failed","Match timed out, not enough players","Room Full","This room is full. Please switch rooms","Score Summary","Score Room","Rounds","Ranking","Share","Stats ready. Long-press to screenshot or share","Score","Lead","Top Card","FlingDeck","FlingDeck","Round","No higher hand, auto passed","Watching ads is a free, reward-based option used only to obtain or restore game progress; viewing ads involves no real-money payment.","Watch Ad","Loading...","Ready","Ad unavailable, please try again later","Daily free ad limit reached, come back tomorrow","+{n} chips","Purchase coming soon: {name}","How to Play","Goal","A 52-card deck (no jokers). Each player gets 13 cards. Be the first to play all your cards to win. In a 3-player game, one seat is held by a virtual player who keeps its cards but does not play or score.","Card Types","Single, Pair, Triple (may carry a pair, not a single), Straight (3+ consecutive singles; circular runs allowed \u2014 among 3-card runs A-2-3 is smallest and K-A-2 is largest, and there is no long run wrapping across 2 like K-A-2-3-\u2026), Consecutive Pairs (2+ pairs; a 2-pair run may stand alone but cannot carry a single, while 3+ pairs may carry one single or stand alone), Consecutive Triples (2\u20134 runs, may carry one single or stand alone), Four-with-One (4+1; a four may only bomb or carry one single \u2014 four-with-two and four-with-two-pairs are not allowed), Bomb = four of a kind (a bare four is a bomb). No jokers, no rocket.","Rules","The opening play must include \u26663 (Diamond 3, the lowest card). On your turn, beat the previous play with a higher play of the same type, or pass. The last player of each trick leads the next trick. A Bomb beats any non-bomb play; bombs compare by rank.","Scoring",'The round ends when a player goes out. Each loser is deducted by "remaining-card bracket \xd7 room multiplier": \u22645 cards \xd75, \u226410 \xd710, \u226412 \xd715, 13 cards (none played) \xd720. The winner gains the sum of all losers\' losses. Bombs give no extra bonus.',"Age Confirmation","18+, Continue","Under 18, Exit","This game is for entertainment only and uses virtual chips; virtual chips may be purchased but cannot be exchanged for cash, goods, or any real currency.","Play responsibly","Confirm","OK","Close","Loading...","Error","Success","New Game","Your turn to play","Played","Passed","Game Over","You lead","Must lead with Diamond 3","Player {n}","Invalid move","You must play","\u26663 holder leads","Player with lowest diamond leads","Lowest diamond leads","Must lead with the lowest diamond","Invite friends","Quick Access","Create and invite friends","Friend {n}","Room Seats","New Player Bonus","Get 100 chips when you complete your first game","+100 Chips","Already at 1000+ chips \u2014 bonus not needed","Weekend Tournament","Compete for 10,000 chips this weekend","Invite Friends","You both get +500 chips for each friend who joins","You +500 / Friend +500","Daily Bonus","Join Now","Player {n}","Invite Friends","Invite Link","I'm playing FlingDeck \u2014 come join the battle! We both get 500 chips. Download: ","Share with friends \u2014 you both get +500 chips","Scan to Download","Profile","XP","Current","Title Gallery","Tap an unlocked title to display it. Titles are cosmetic only \u2014 no gameplay bonuses.","Games","Win Rate","Best Streak","Equipped","Tap to show","Reach Lv {n}","Level Up! Lv.{n}","Title Unlocked","View Gallery","View Gallery","Player Card","Switch Title","New Arrival","Dragon-Ring Dweller","Lei-Cha Lad","Scholar-Farmer","Hill Trekker","Ferryfolk","Mountain Passer","Peddler","Skipper","River Crosser","Sea Voyager","Overseas Sojourner","Hakka Luminary","Streak Star","Deca-Streak","Bomber","Four Suits","Night Owl","Ever-Victorious","Veteran","Win 3 in a row","Win 10 in a row","Play 50 bombs in total","Play all four suits in one round","Finish 10 games between 0\u20135 AM","Win rate \u226560% over 50+ games","Finish 100 games","Game not started","Not your turn","Select cards to play","First play must include diamond 3","First play must include the lowest diamond {n}","Invalid hand type","Invalid hand","Can only beat with a bomb","Must play the same type ({t})","Must have the same length ({n})","Not strong enough","Single","Pair","Triple","Triple + single","Triple + pair","Straight","Consecutive pairs","Twin trios","Triple trios","Quad trios","Two-trio run + single","Three-trio run + single","Three-pair run + single","Four-pair run + single","Triple Run + 1","Pair Run + 1","Pairs + single","Airplane","Airplane + wings","Airplane + pairs","Four + one","Bomb","Hand"],t.yf)
